veltos-ai (1.1.0~dev4) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Only what was asked: actions whose topic the user's words do not mention
    are neither shown nor done; the local model gets no tools after an action.
  * A command's output is folded under its card (a few lines tall when open);
    long words and lines wrap in answers.
  * Three typing dots while waiting, the answer's words appear smoothly, the
    view glides down.
  * Wide windows: a side bar (new chat, suggestions, settings) and a wider
    conversation; the settings button shows when settings are open and says
    why they stay open without a service.
  * With the local model, switches that worked (light/dark, Wi-Fi,
    Bluetooth, night light, sound, brightness...) are confirmed in VeltOS'
    own words ("Koyu moda geçildi.") instead of the small model's.

 -- VeltOS Developers <1ahmetfurkandemir@gmail.com>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000

veltos-ai (1.1.0~dev3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The conversation is kept until "New chat" (conversation.py); a kept
    conversation from another service is told to the new one; a stopped
    answer stays in the history.
  * The local model gets as much of the conversation as fits its context.
  * The chat is a list model changed in place: the view follows the answer
    while at the end, stays where the user scrolled, a button leads back.
  * Wide and maximised windows: a centred column of reading width.

